<!--
    Themed-icon layer (Android 13+ Material You): the same mark as
    ic_blogmark_mark, flattened to one opaque colour for the system to tint
    from the wallpaper palette.

    Opaque throughout rather than keeping the alpha steps. The system tints
    this layer and paints it on a background it chooses, so a bar held at 45%
    can land close enough to that background to disappear; the four heights
    are what make the mark read, and they survive without the weighting.
-->
